{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QuarkState.OneSidedWeakVertex","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecificLimits.Basic"],"declarations":24,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.tendsto_normalised_pow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.tendsto_normalised_pow","kind":"theorem","line":276,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L276-L287","doc":"**For `|q| > 1`, `q^{−N} s^N → P₊`**: the long positive braid projects onto the\n`q`-line, which is the dominant (modulus `> 1`) line. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.ratio_tendsto","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.ratio_tendsto","kind":"theorem","line":269,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L269-L274","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.normalised_pow_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.normalised_pow_eq","kind":"theorem","line":247,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L247-L255","doc":"`q^{−N} s^N = P₊ + (−q⁻²)^N P₋`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.pow_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.pow_eq","kind":"theorem","line":238,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L238-L245","doc":"`s^N = q^N P₊ + (−q⁻¹)^N P₋`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.modLine_eq_signLine_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.modLine_eq_signLine_iff","kind":"theorem","line":217,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L217-L227","doc":"**The two selectors agree on a letter with positive parameter iff `q > 1`**\n(given the lines are distinct). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.modLine_flip","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.modLine_flip","kind":"theorem","line":208,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L208-L215","doc":"**The modulus selector is flavour-covariant**: for `s⁻¹` it is the other line. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.signLine_flip","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.signLine_flip","kind":"theorem","line":203,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L203-L206","doc":"**The sign selector is flavour-invariant**: the inverse letter `s⁻¹` (a letter at\n`q⁻¹`) has the same positive line. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.modLine_neg_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.modLine_neg_inv","kind":"theorem","line":191,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L191-L201","doc":"**The modulus selector is a function of the letter**, off `|q| = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.signLine_neg_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.signLine_neg_inv","kind":"theorem","line":182,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L182-L189","doc":"**The sign selector is a function of the letter** (independent of the root label). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.modLine_of_one_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.modLine_of_one_lt","kind":"theorem","line":180,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L180-L180","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.signLine_of_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.signLine_of_pos","kind":"theorem","line":178,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L178-L178","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.modLine","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.modLine","kind":"def","line":175,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L175-L176","doc":"The line of the eigenvalue of modulus `> 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.signLine","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.signLine","kind":"def","line":172,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L172-L173","doc":"The line of the POSITIVE eigenvalue. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.h_pos_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.h_pos_iff","kind":"theorem","line":159,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L159-L170","doc":"On a positive parameter, `h > 0` iff `q > 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.oneSidedL_eq_oneSidedR_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.oneSidedL_eq_oneSidedR_iff","kind":"theorem","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L133-L147","doc":"**`W_L = W_R` iff `h = 0`**: the L/R distinction of the one-sided vertex exists\nexactly off the classical points `q² = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.skein_neg_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.skein_neg_inv","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L117-L122","doc":"**The skein weighting under relabelling**: `q s − q⁻¹ s⁻¹` becomes minus the mirror\nweighting `q⁻¹ s − q s⁻¹`. \"Which crossing carries `q`\" is \"which root is called `q`\". ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.oneSidedL_neg_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.oneSidedL_neg_inv","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L108-L115","doc":"**Relabelling the root turns the L-only vertex into the R-only vertex**, with the\nsame letter `s`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.grading_neg_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.grading_neg_inv","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L104-L106","doc":"Relabelling the root sends `J ↦ −J`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.Pm_neg_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.Pm_neg_inv","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L97-L102","doc":"`P₋(−q⁻¹) = P₊(q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.Pp_neg_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.Pp_neg_inv","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L89-L95","doc":"Relabelling the root swaps the lines: `P₊(−q⁻¹) = P₋(q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.flip_neg_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.flip_neg_inv","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L86-L87","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.isLetter_neg_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.isLetter_neg_inv","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L82-L84","doc":"**A letter does not know its parameter**: `q` and `−q⁻¹` give the same relation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.bracket_neg_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.bracket_neg_inv","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L79-L80","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.h_neg_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakChiralityRootLabel.h_neg_inv","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakChiralityRootLabel.lean#L76-L77","signatureChunk":0}]}